  Preheat the #air fryer basket{} so it's hot and ready to go. This helps ensure a crispy, not steamed, texture.

Prep the @tempeh{1%8oz package} by cutting into bite-sized cubes. Add the tempeh to a large #bowl{}.

Toss the cubed tempeh with the @cooking oil{1/2%tbsp} and your choice of @seasonings{1%tsp}.

Spread the seasoned tempeh in a single layer in the basket of the preheated #air fryer{}. Pop it back in and cook at 390 to 400 degrees F for about ~{10%minutes}. Pause to shake halfway through, and adjust the cooking time as needed (up to ~{15%minutes}).

> For cooking oil, try avocado or peanut oil.
> For seasonings, try all-purpose seasoning, salt & pepper, or garlic powder and chili flakes.